{
  "title": "Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.)'s prayer for security",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This supplicatory prayer is ascribed to the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) who used to say it for security against jinn and human beings:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-Beneficent, the All-Merciful.\nلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ \nLAAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE TAWAKKALTO\nThere is no god but Allah; in Him I have placed my trust, \nوَ هُوَ رَبُّ الْعَرْشِ الْعَظِيْمِ \nWA HOWA RABBUL A’RSHIL A’ZEEME\nand He is the Lord of the Great Throne. \nمَا شَاۤءَ اللّٰهُ كَانَ وَ مَالَمْ يَشَاْ لَمْ يَكُنْ \nMAA SHAAA-AL LAAHO KAANA WA MAA LAM YASHA’ LAM YAKUN \nWhatever Allah wills comes to be, and whatever He does not will does not come to be. \nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ اللّٰهَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ \nASHHADO ANNAL LAAHA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN\nI bear witness that Allah is Powerful over all things, \nوَ اَنَّ اللّٰهَ قَدْ اَحَاطَ بِكُلِّ شَيْءٍ عِلْمًا \nWA ANNAL LAAHA QAD AHAATA BE-KULLE SHAY-IN I’LMAN\nand that Allah has encompassed all things in knowledge.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْۤ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ نَفْسِىْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEEE A-O’OZO BEKA MIN SHARRE NAFSEE \nO Allah, indeed I seek refuge with You from the evil of my own self, \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ دَآبَّةٍ اَنْتَ اٰخِذٌ ۢبِنَاصِيَتِهَاۤ \nWA MIN SHARRE KULLE DAAABBATIN ANTA AAKHEZUM BE-NAASEYATEHAAA \nand from the evil of every moving creature that You hold by its forelock. \nاِنَّ رَبِّىْ عَلٰى صِرَاطٍ مُسْتَقِيْمٍ.\nINNA RABBEE A’LAA SERAATIM MUSTAQEEMIN.\nIndeed, my Lord is upon a straight path."
}
